<title>UK: Euromarket turnover fell in week to Jan 23 - ISMA.</title>
<headline>Euromarket turnover fell in week to Jan 23 - ISMA.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-01-24</dateline>
<text>
<p>Turnover in Eurobond and related markets fell to $1.070 billion in the week to January 23 from $1.083 trillion the previous week, International Securities Market Association data showed (in billions of dollars):</p>
<p>					  Latest week	Previous week</p>
<p> Primary market:		     49.43		54.87</p>
<p> Of which U.S. dollar issues     25.45		29.24</p>
<p> Secondary market:		 1020.57	    1028.58</p>
<p> Of which U.S. dollar issues    823.08	     204.80</p>
<p> Cleared through Euroclear	787.81	     793.65</p>
<p> Cleared through Cedel	    281.86	     289.80</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
</text>
